  "headline": "God of War Ragnarok endgame (Missions 14-18 and postgame): gear-set plan and the Berserkers to King Hrolf route",
  "description": "An endgame plan focused on removing failure modes: short punish windows, stability-first gear, and a clear postgame order: materials, Berserkers, then King Hrolf.",
  "keywords": [
    "god of war ragnarok endgame",
    "postgame",
    "berserkers",
    "king hrolf",
    "best armor"
  ],
  "articleBody": "Scope: The Path missions 14-18 plus postgame. The win condition is consistency: punish once, reset, and keep upgrades on pace for optional bosses.\n\n1) Goals\n- Shield counters to create safe punish windows\n- Short, landable runics over long animations\n- Build a stability baseline, then add burst pieces only when consistent\n\n2) Skill priorities\n- Shield: reinforce your punish window creation\n- Runics: short and reliable\n- Companion: a \"stop\" tool for boss specials\n\n3) Gear roles\n- Ultra-stability: best first choice for optional bosses\n- Burst endgame: use once stable (partial adoption is fine)\n\n4) Postgame order (the \"what to do after beating the game\" answer)\n1) collect materials and raise baseline levels\n2) fight Berserkers with stability builds\n3) unlock and fight King Hrolf\n4) swap to burst for farming\n\nRelated: jump to the all-Berserkers index and the King Hrolf page from the hub.",
